{"id":462,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"体験と探究を通じて考え表す力を伸ばす中学","feature_description":"獨協埼玉中学校では、体験を通じて知識を確かめる学習や中学総合学習を行い、観察・実験・調査から考える力を育てます。英語では反復学習を取り入れ、基礎を重ねて使える力につなげます。レポートや発表、討論の機会も設け、学んだ内容を整理して相手に伝える力を伸ばす方針です。幅広い授業を通じ、課題を多角的に考え表現する力も育みます。日々の学びでも考える力を育てます。","clubs":[{"id":9143,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9144,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9146,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9147,"name":"男子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9148,"name":"女子硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9149,"name":"男子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9150,"name":"女子バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9151,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9152,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9155,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9156,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9158,"name":"コーラス部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo-saitama.ed.jp/life/club_j/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":9159,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.dokkyo